# Spike 17 demo, played: blue's controls, as a person uses them. After the
# title card (3 s): select the base, look at the builders' tabs, place a
# factory, narrow to the old factory with its tile, queue units, switch
# repeat on, look at its logistics page, then send the engineers off.
at 3.5 drag 450,200 1150,700            # the base: a factory and two engineers
at 3.7 expect selected >= 3
at 4.2 shot base                        # builders: the economy tab
at 5.0 key Q                            # an extractor, to place
at 5.1 move 760,330
at 5.6 shot placing
at 6.0 key Escape
at 6.5 key V                            # the build tab
at 6.8 key Q                            # a factory
at 7.0 move 640,300
at 7.4 shot factory-ghost
at 7.8 click 640,300                    # placed: the engineers go to build it
at 8.0 expect sent build == 1
at 8.6 click 170,750                    # the factory's tile: only the factory
at 8.8 expect selected == 1
at 9.2 shot factory
at 9.6 key Q                            # a raider
at 10.0 key W shift                     # five tanks
at 10.4 key Y                           # repeat on
at 10.8 expect sent produce == 2
at 11.0 expect sent repeat == 1
at 11.4 shot queued
at 12.0 key X                           # the logistics page: trucks
at 12.6 shot logistics
at 13.2 drag 450,200 1150,700
at 13.5 click 60,750                    # the engineers' tile
at 13.8 expect selected == 2
at 14.2 shot engineers
at 14.6 key M                           # move, then where
at 15.2 click 980,360
at 15.4 expect sent move == 1
at 16.0 shot moving
at 17.0 quit
